#!/usr/bin/env node
// Browser oracle for docs/mockups/workbench-v3.html — the thick-client shell (activity rail · one-row toolbar · docks · bottom panel).
// It verifies the review artifact's interaction contracts and the shell contract; it proves nothing about a native app, a kernel or a solver.
// Usage: node tools/check-mockup-v3.mjs [<node_modules dir containing playwright>]
